          "image_source": "images/page_19_image_17.jpg"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph_title",
          "bbox": [
            0.151,
            0.801,
            0.404,
            0.824
          ],
          "level": 2,
          "content": "Angle Sum Property"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.11,
            0.836,
            0.761,
            0.859
          ],
          "content": "？ What can we say about the sum of the angles of any triangle?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.149,
            0.863,
            0.849,
            0.92
          ],
          "content": "Consider a triangle ABC. To find the sum of its angles, we can use the same method of drawing a line parallel to the base: construct a line through A that is parallel to BC."
        },
